model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "A successful driver observation newer than a current failed health check requests one check through the existing driver health lifecycle and deadline. The observation never sets health directly. Cached readings do not repeat a completed check or overwrite a newer failure; missing hooks, failures, unavailable sources and credential-generation changes retain their normal behavior. The existing observation lease and cooldown bound calls, without changing storage or authorization."
    }
  }
}
